{"id":"ewig","lemma":"ewig","pos":"adv","rank":806,"glosses":["eternally, for ever","always"],"ipa":"/ˈeːvɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/De-ewig.ogg/De-ewig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Würdest du wirklich ewig leben wollen?","en":"Would you really want to live forever?","words":[{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"really, actually"},null,{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"to want"}]},{"text":"Ich kann nicht ewig warten.","en":"I can't wait forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to wait"}]},{"text":"Wir kennen uns schon ewig.","en":"We go way back.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/746625","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"already"},null]},{"text":"Sie wird ihn auf ewig lieben.","en":"She'll love him forever.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"on"},null,{"g":"to love"}]},{"text":"Der Krieg kann nicht ewig dauern.","en":"The war can't last forever.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"war, warfare"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to last"}]}]}